            <title>3.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 00:13:09 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>153</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- A pane restored at launch no longer stays blank white. WebKit's GPU process could hang in CoreAudio and never be replaced; Canopy now ends a GPU process WebKit has abandoned so the page paints again.
- Opening a session from the phone no longer leaves a faded ghost row drawn over the sidebar.
]]></description>
