        <item>
            <title>3.1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 21:31:04 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>152</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The context meter takes the context window straight from the Claude CLI (through a small bundled mod), so it shows a denominator before the first reply and stays right when a subagent uses a different model.
- Opening Recent sessions from the phone answers from the list the Mac already holds instead of rescanning every transcript first, so the list appears at once.

### Bug Fixes
- Sessions started in a folder whose name contains Japanese or other non-ASCII characters, an underscore, or an emoji now find their own history: project names, Continue session, titles and message counts were missing for them.
- A session opened from the phone is no longer stopped after it sits idle with no client attached, and it is resumed after Canopy updates its background service.
]]></description>
